window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>For Lorelei Clay, no good deed goes unpunished....</i></p> <p>Reluctant ghost whisperer Lorelei Clay wants a working moat, which is the only reason she agrees to help with yet another supernatural situation. The simple ghostbusting job quickly escalates when Lorelei discovers the involvement of a powerful and ancient collective not known for their social skills.</p> <p>Lorelei wants nothing more than to get back to her renovations and her life of solitude, but it becomes painfully clear that if she can’t fix this small-town problem, Fairhaven is going to suffer big-time consequences.</p> <p><b><i>Dead of Night</i></b><b> </b>is the second book in the <i>Crossroads Queen </i>urban fantasy series.</p>"; 
